  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Inside Studio One before the live Twelve Singers finale, a crew member guides entertainment reporter Bianbian to a seat in the packed media row. Listen to their exchange first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "媒体席位置一直很满。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "您第一次来，只能给您安排在那儿了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "还请您多包涵。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你们今天对我这样已经不错了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "您真是厉害，难怪能写出那么犀利的稿子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "犀利什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "辛惠美这事也就火了三天，就从头条上下来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "要不是有人爆了照片，我估计两天都撑不住。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "您快别说了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "不然你们能认识我，能请我来这儿吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "媒体席位置一直很满。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Seats in the press section have been completely full.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "您第一次来，只能给您安排在那儿了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Since this is your first visit, we could only seat you over there.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "还请您多包涵。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please bear with us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你们今天对我这样已经不错了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Treating me this well today is already very generous of you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "您真是厉害，难怪能写出那么犀利的稿子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are impressive; no wonder you write such sharp articles.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "犀利什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sharp in what way?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "辛惠美这事也就火了三天，就从头条上下来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That story with Xin Huimei was hot for just three days before dropping off the headlines.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "要不是有人爆了照片，我估计两天都撑不住。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Had someone not leaked that photo, I reckon it would not have lasted two days.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "您快别说了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please stop saying that.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "不然你们能认识我，能请我来这儿吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Otherwise would you know me and invite me here?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
